## **📌 Project Overview**
Your project is a **web-based image gallery** where users can:
✔️ Register and log in  
✔️ Upload images with descriptions  
✔️ View all uploaded images  
✔️ Delete images  
✔️ Update their profile  

The project is built using **Java (Servlets, JSP), MySQL, and Apache Tomcat**.

