## **📂 DAO (Database Access)**
- **UserDAO**: Handles user authentication & registration  
- **ImageDAO**: Manages image insert, delete, and retrieval  

Example **ImageDAO.java** Method:
```java
public List<Image> selectAllImages() {
    List<Image> images = new ArrayList<>();
    try (Connection connection = getConnection();
         PreparedStatement preparedStatement = connection.prepareStatement("SELECT * FROM images")) {
        ResultSet rs = preparedStatement.executeQuery();
        while (rs.next()) {
            images.add(new Image(rs.getInt("id"), rs.getString("name"), rs.getString("description"), rs.getString("file_path")));
        }
    } catch (SQLException e) {
        e.printStackTrace();
    }
    return images;
}
```

